  "interpretation": "Single-MIR sessions without a typed/untyped split are plotted as Lambda typed. Results5-8 are partial tests and are omitted from the axis. The C2MIR series begins at Result18 because Results2-4 use Lambda scripts through the C2MIR transpiler, while Result18 onward reports native C benchmark ports. Python is reported in Results3-4; Go is reported in Result18. Node.js is the 1.0x reference line.",
